{"id":"5ed2b55b4cca2b52","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-henkin-modal-logic.md","title":"Normal Henkin-Axiom Logic","display":"df-henkin-modal-logic — Normal Henkin-Axiom Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-henkin-modal-logic","aliases":["89-df-henkin-modal-logic"],"display":"df-henkin-modal-logic — Normal Henkin-Axiom Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-henkin-modal-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-henkin-modal-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-henkin-modal-logic — Normal Henkin-Axiom Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K\">\\(\\mathrm K\\)</span> 为已有最小正规模态逻辑；下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_H\">\\(\\mathcal A_H\\)</span> 是下面定义的 Henkin 公理实例集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H\">\\(\\mathrm H\\)</span> 是包含它的最小正规模态逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_H&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm H&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm K\\cup\\mathcal A_H\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\n\\land\\forall A\\in X(\\Box A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_H&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm H&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm K\\cup\\mathcal A_H\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\n\\land\\forall A\\in X(\\Box A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 11 章，印刷页 149–154；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。公理结论是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span>，经 p.149 原页图像核对。\n交集族非空，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 本身属于其中；其交集对 MP 与必然化闭合。公理集含全部模式实例，替换闭包由有限推导归纳得到。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to A\">\\(\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to A\\)</span> 是另一模式，不能用它代替这里的 Henkin 公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k","status":"resolved","id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm K","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_H&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to\\Box A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm H&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\mathrm K\\cup\\mathcal A_H\\subseteq X\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\n\\land\\forall A\\in X(\\Box A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(A\\leftrightarrow\\Box A)\\to A","display":false}],"bytes":1464,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9ec54437321db8d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a504f38ba12874d6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ff346ee0085d8f22","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]] → [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]] → [[89-thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete]]"}],"outgoing":["550226a6aaff441c"]}